WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:03.340
Many people finish an experience like this

00:03.340 --> 00:05.000
and feel a surge of motivation

00:05.000 --> 00:07.320
and then they think in a few weeks

00:07.320 --> 00:08.580
they're gonna keep moving forward

00:08.580 --> 00:10.520
and then they realize the binder

00:10.520 --> 00:12.480
and the notes go on the shelf

00:12.480 --> 00:15.200
and old habits start to creep back in.

00:15.200 --> 00:17.740
That will not be your story.

00:17.740 --> 00:18.980
Why?

00:18.980 --> 00:20.640
Because the M.V.P. Accelerator

00:20.640 --> 00:23.720
is not a one and done training event.

00:23.720 --> 00:24.680
No, no, no.

00:24.680 --> 00:27.800
We didn't just give you information.

00:27.840 --> 00:30.380
We gave you an operating system.

00:38.960 --> 00:41.700
The 90-Day Way isn't a one time fix.

00:41.700 --> 00:44.620
It's your operating system for a lifetime

00:44.620 --> 00:48.720
of peak performance and strategic recovery.

00:49.700 --> 00:52.560
It's a foundation you build upon forever,

00:52.560 --> 00:55.720
starting fresh each season.

00:55.720 --> 00:57.640
The end of this 90 day plan

00:57.640 --> 01:00.080
is simply the beginning of the next.

01:00.080 --> 01:02.160
You now have a proven system

01:02.160 --> 01:04.440
for setting purposeful goals

01:04.440 --> 01:07.520
and achieving them in manageable sprints

01:07.520 --> 01:11.400
for the rest of your life and leadership.

01:11.400 --> 01:13.000
Think about that.

01:13.000 --> 01:17.380
You have a tool that you can use every single quarter

01:17.380 --> 01:19.620
to ensure you are consistently

01:19.620 --> 01:23.340
and intentionally moving towards your grand vision.

01:23.340 --> 01:26.420
The goal isn't just a complete one 90 day plan.

01:26.420 --> 01:29.420
It's to master the rhythm of the 90-Day Way.

01:29.420 --> 01:30.820
And let's be realistic.

01:30.820 --> 01:34.340
Some of your goals will take longer than 90 days

01:34.340 --> 01:36.300
and delay will happen.

01:36.300 --> 01:38.400
The rhythm isn't about perfection.

01:38.400 --> 01:42.580
It's about persistent focused progress.

01:42.580 --> 01:46.320
Your M.V.P. blueprint is also a living document.

01:46.320 --> 01:47.700
The person you are today

01:47.700 --> 01:50.500
is not the same person you will be in a year

01:50.500 --> 01:51.940
or in five years.

01:51.940 --> 01:53.380
Your priorities will shift.

01:53.380 --> 01:55.100
Your wisdom will deepen.

01:55.100 --> 01:58.180
I encourage you to schedule time on your calendar,

01:58.180 --> 02:03.180
maybe once or twice a year to revisit and refine your M.V.P.

02:03.260 --> 02:05.420
Does your purpose still ring true?

02:05.420 --> 02:07.380
Has your vision evolved?

02:07.380 --> 02:09.820
Does your mission need to adapt to a new role

02:09.820 --> 02:12.020
or a new stage of life?

02:12.020 --> 02:14.860
The document isn't meant to be static.

02:14.860 --> 02:17.060
It's meant to evolve with you.

02:17.980 --> 02:22.140
Athleadership is a commitment to continuous conditioning.

02:22.140 --> 02:24.920
It's the daily choice to lead with purpose,

02:24.920 --> 02:27.500
to manage your energy, to stay agile

02:27.500 --> 02:30.000
and to bounce back with resilience.

02:30.000 --> 02:32.380
The tools you gained in this experience

02:32.380 --> 02:34.940
will serve you for a lifetime.

02:34.940 --> 02:38.540
But only if you continue to use them,

02:38.540 --> 02:42.540
to sharpen them, to make them your own.

02:42.540 --> 02:45.940
This is your commitment to a career of impact

02:45.940 --> 02:47.740
and a life of meaning.

02:47.740 --> 02:52.060
One that is clear, focused and sustainable.

